			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"### 🎥 Motion-Controlled T2V Workflow  \n`Use your own video to guide motion in text-to-video generation`\n\nThis workflow allows you to upload a **reference video** to guide the motion and timing of your generated output. Perfect for matching character animation to real human movement.\n\n🛠️ How it works:\n\n1. 📹 Upload your own **reference video** into the `Upload Video` node  \n  → This could be a clip of yourself acting out a scene or performing a motion\n\n2. 📝 Write your **text prompt** as usual  \n  → Focus on character details, background, lighting, and overall style  \n  → You **don’t need to describe camera motion** — it’s already embedded in the control video\n\n3. 🔁 The model uses the uploaded video to extract motion, while applying your prompt to generate a new cinematic result\n\n📌 This is ideal for:\n- Character animation  \n- Matching action or gesture timing  \n- Custom motion reference for fine-tuned outputs\n\n🧠 Tips: \n- Match the framing of your character to the composition you want in the final result\n\n---\n"
			],
			"inputs":[
				
			],
			"flags":{
				
			},
			"type":"MarkdownNote",
			"title":"## READ ME",
			"mode":0,
			"bgcolor":"#653",
			"size":[
