			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"## 📦 WAN Models to Download\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 Main WAN Model  \n`Wan2.1_14B_T2V-FusionX`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://civitai.com/models/1651125?modelVersionId=1868891)\n\n🗂️ Place in: `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models`\n\n---\n\n### 🟣 WAN VAE  \n`WAN2.1-VAE_module_14B_bf16.safetensors`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Wan2_1_VAE_bf16.safetensors?download=true)\n\n🗂️ Place in: `ComfyUI/models/vae`\n\n\n---\n### 🟣 WAN Text Encoder\n`umt5-xxl-enc-bf16.safetensors`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/umt5-xxl-enc-bf16.safetensors)\n\n🗂️ Place in: `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders`\n\n---\n### 🟣 WAN VACE Module\n`Wan2_1-VACE_module_14B_bf16.safetensors`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Wan2_1-VACE_module_14B_bf16.safetensors?download=true)\n### OR\n`Wan2_1-VACE_module_14B_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Wan2_1-VACE_module_14B_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors?download=true)\n\n🗂️ Place in: `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models`\n\n\n---\n### ⚠️ Torch Compile Warning  \nIf your setup doesn’t support torch compile, set attention mode to `sdpa` in the model loader and bypas the Torch Compile settings and adjust the base_precision to just fp16\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Block Swapping\nBlock swapping helps if you have lower VRAM and/or get OOM. RTX 5090 uses the current settings to prevent OOM. Raise the number till you no longer OOM (up to 40)\n\n\n\n\n\n"
			],
